{"path":"coroutine/noop_coroutine","title":"std::noop_coroutine","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>noop_coroutine","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/coroutine/noop_coroutine","section":"coroutine","kind":"page","summary":"Returns a coroutine handle referring to a no-op coroutine.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/coroutine\">&lt;coroutine&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/coroutine/coroutine_handle\"><span class=\"kw3267\">std::<span class=\"me2\">noop_coroutine_handle</span></span></a> noop_coroutine<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns a coroutine handle referring to a no-op coroutine.\n</p><p>If there has been already a coroutine state of no-op coroutine, it is unspecified whether a subsequent call to <code>noop_coroutine</code> returns a previously obtained coroutine handle, or a coroutine handle referring to a new coroutine state of no-op coroutine.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>A <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/coroutine/coroutine_handle\">std::noop_coroutine_handle</a></span> referring to a no-op coroutine.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>Return values from different calls to <code>noop_coroutine</code> may and may not compare equal.\n</p><p><code>noop_coroutine</code> may only return a <code>noop_coroutine_handle</code> referring to a coroutine state object without starting a coroutine.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exampl